  "body": "Are you looking for a brand-new home that's stylish, low maintenance, and ready to enjoy? This beautifully designed three-bedroom home in the growing Strathmill community could be exactly what you've been searching for.\r\n\r\nMultiple homes are available to view, giving buyers the opportunity to compare layouts and find the home that best suits their lifestyle.\r\n\r\nThis home offers light-filled open-plan living that flows seamlessly from the kitchen and dining area to a private outdoor space, perfect for relaxing with family and friends.\r\nFeaturing three generous bedrooms, including a master retreat with ensuite and outdoor access, plus a single internal-access garage and additional off-street parking, this home combines comfort and convenience in all the right ways.\r\n\r\nKey features include:\r\n\r\n* Three bedrooms, including a master with ensuite and walk in wardrobe\r\n* Master bedroom with ranch slider opening directly to the deck\r\n* Modern open plan kitchen, dining and lounge with great natural light\r\n* Large deck offering easy outdoor living and entertaining\r\n* Single internal-access garage plus one off-street park\r\n* Low maintenance 201 sqm; section, ideal for busy households\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing, or adding to your investment portfolio, this is an opportunity not to be missed.\r\n\r\nYou'll love the lifestyle on offer here. Enjoy the convenience of nearby motorway links, Orewa Beach, local cafes, schools and shopping. Nature lovers will appreciate having Alice Eaves Scenic Reserve approximately a 3.5km walk away, where walking tracks wind through native forest and past impressive kauri trees, providing a peaceful place to explore and enjoy the outdoors.\r\n\r\nContact Shaun Burnett on 021 871 252 or Ann Park on 021 151 8458 for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
